* Two quantities (tracerbndIM1, tracerbndIM2) share Slib_Noord.pli: they must end up in
* the same Slib_Noord.bc. Slib_Oost.pli is used by tracerbndIM1 only (control case).

QUANTITY     =tracerbndIM1
FILENAME     =Slib_Noord.pli
FILETYPE     =9
METHOD       =3
OPERAND      =O

QUANTITY     =tracerbndIM1
FILENAME     =Slib_Oost.pli
FILETYPE     =9
METHOD       =3
OPERAND      =O

QUANTITY     =tracerbndIM2
FILENAME     =Slib_Noord.pli
FILETYPE     =9
METHOD       =3
OPERAND      =O
